WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 38=

01:39.620 --> 01:41.300
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)
I'm not going.

01:41.980 --> 01:43.380
I've spent 50 years

01:43.620 --> 01:46.420
drowning in endless schemes.

01:47.100 --> 01:48.940
I've lost my beloved wife,

01:51.060 --> 01:52.740
and now my children too.

01:57.060 --> 01:58.060
I truly am alone

01:59.220 --> 02:01.060
in this world.

02:02.660 --> 02:03.580
Your Majesty.

02:04.260 --> 02:06.340
As long as there's
still breath in you...

02:06.460 --> 02:08.620
Say no more.

02:10.220 --> 02:12.500
I'm not going anywhere.

02:13.220 --> 02:14.780
Fleeing south,
seeking refuge in the west.

02:14.940 --> 02:16.460
Wandering from place to place.

02:17.740 --> 02:20.140
I can't endure it anymore.

02:22.100 --> 02:23.540
I am the Son of Heaven.

02:24.700 --> 02:27.220
I can't die on the flight.

02:28.860 --> 02:30.100
I'll stay right here

02:31.380 --> 02:33.660
and let the people of Sheng'an know

02:35.180 --> 02:36.020
that at least

02:37.020 --> 02:38.860
I didn't abandon them.

02:47.340 --> 02:48.140
Jiyuan.

02:51.460 --> 02:53.820
Remember when we were young?

02:57.500 --> 03:00.460
We had such grand ambitions.

03:06.100 --> 03:07.980
Now they're all gone.

03:11.540 --> 03:12.540
Go on.

03:15.220 --> 03:17.620
Huai still needs you.

03:21.140 --> 03:24.740
Your Majesty, we're both old men now.

03:26.820 --> 03:27.980
This parting

03:30.220 --> 03:32.100
shall be our last.

04:03.180 --> 04:06.180
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)

04:25.540 --> 04:26.900
Go load the things onto the carts.

04:27.500 --> 04:28.220
Be careful.

04:28.460 --> 04:28.780
Yes, sir.

04:50.260 --> 04:50.860
Safe travels.

04:56.660 --> 04:57.100
Yan Shang.

04:58.660 --> 04:59.380
Do you realize

05:00.420 --> 05:01.540
that even if you stay,

05:02.220 --> 05:03.540
they won't be grateful to you?

05:04.700 --> 05:05.180
They'll only

05:06.340 --> 05:07.060
resent you.

05:11.620 --> 05:12.620
Because your presence

05:14.180 --> 05:16.700
only throws their cowardice and baseness

05:17.300 --> 05:17.860
into sharper relief!

05:21.780 --> 05:22.340
What about you?

05:25.220 --> 05:26.180
Do you resent me too?

05:33.660 --> 05:34.140
Yan Shang.

05:36.260 --> 05:38.980
You're just as annoying as you were
back in school.

05:42.580 --> 05:43.500
But back then,

05:44.900 --> 05:45.740
you always helped me.

05:46.340 --> 05:47.060
That's not a contradiction.

05:49.580 --> 05:50.620
I saw you as a friend,

05:51.740 --> 05:53.220
yet I couldn't help but resent you.

05:58.420 --> 05:58.660
No.

06:02.140 --> 06:02.980
Perhaps I was just...

06:06.460 --> 06:07.260
jealous.

06:11.580 --> 06:13.180
Because I knew better than anyone

06:15.740 --> 06:16.740
how clever

06:18.620 --> 06:19.740
and gifted you were.

06:20.380 --> 06:21.820
You seem to see through everything.

06:32.180 --> 06:34.220
You listened to all my arrogant nonsense

06:35.380 --> 06:37.620
and watched me daydream
about the future.

06:42.900 --> 06:44.100
Yet you never once called me out.

06:48.100 --> 06:49.220
Because I envied you.

06:50.980 --> 06:51.860
Your privilege.

06:52.740 --> 06:53.340
Your composure.

06:54.140 --> 06:54.580
Your righteousness.

06:55.500 --> 06:56.420
Your high spirits.

06:57.580 --> 06:59.060
I'd never known any of them.

07:04.740 --> 07:05.740
And I'd never had

07:08.420 --> 07:09.980
a friend like you.

07:23.780 --> 07:24.300
What about now?

07:27.860 --> 07:28.860
Do you still see me as a friend?

07:49.860 --> 07:50.180
Yan Shang.

07:52.180 --> 07:52.540
Take care.

08:08.140 --> 08:08.900
We'll meet again.

08:38.540 --> 08:39.820
Stay safe.

08:42.340 --> 08:44.980
Stay safe.

08:48.380 --> 08:49.460
Be safe.

08:50.700 --> 08:53.660
Stay safe.

08:55.020 --> 08:56.340
Stay safe.

09:03.700 --> 09:08.580
(Guanghua Gate)

09:13.300 --> 09:13.980
How is it?

09:17.460 --> 09:17.900
Sir.

09:23.300 --> 09:24.220
Before the fighting begins,

09:24.740 --> 09:26.180
I'll have the city gates opened briefly.

09:26.740 --> 09:27.420
Anyone who wishes to leave,

09:27.740 --> 09:28.460
civilian or official,

09:28.820 --> 09:29.540
may do so at once.

09:30.420 --> 09:32.060
I'll also station a cavalry unit
inside the city

09:32.620 --> 09:34.140
in case the rebels launch
a surprise attack.

09:35.740 --> 09:36.540
Don't worry.

09:37.460 --> 09:39.140
Mu Xun is unscrupulous

09:40.020 --> 09:41.380
and suspicious by nature.

09:41.620 --> 09:43.140
He won't dare attack

09:43.780 --> 09:45.500
until he knows what's going on.

09:46.020 --> 09:47.100
But he'll certainly

09:47.620 --> 09:49.220
post men at the gates.

09:50.980 --> 09:52.100
He'll soon know

09:52.420 --> 09:53.820
when the imperial carriage leaves
the city.

09:57.340 --> 09:58.980
Whether we make it out

10:00.100 --> 10:01.740
will be up to fate.

10:07.020 --> 10:09.100
What do you think

10:09.580 --> 10:10.300
of Mu Xun's troops?

10:14.580 --> 10:16.140
Huai has yet to recover its strength.

10:16.780 --> 10:18.380
The regional governors are sitting
on the sidelines,

10:18.780 --> 10:20.180
while foreign powers eye us hungrily.

10:21.380 --> 10:23.020
The armies of Handong and Hanbei

10:23.300 --> 10:24.780
are among Huai's finest.

10:25.580 --> 10:27.100
It'd be a terrible waste

10:27.700 --> 10:28.420
to lose them all at Sheng'an.

10:30.220 --> 10:30.900
If possible,

10:31.660 --> 10:33.380
I'd rather keep them at a standoff

10:34.580 --> 10:35.900
and wait for a chance to win.

10:36.700 --> 10:38.260
Better than a direct clash
that leaves both sides

10:38.660 --> 10:39.380
with casualties.

10:40.540 --> 10:41.300
Good.

10:41.940 --> 10:43.260
That you can see this far

10:43.860 --> 10:45.020
shows you understand

10:45.460 --> 10:47.740
not only victory and defeat,
but the fate of the realm.

10:49.500 --> 10:50.940
I'm relieved.

10:57.540 --> 10:58.300
Yan Shang.

10:59.740 --> 11:02.700
I made you Commandant of the Guards
to defend this besieged city.

11:03.340 --> 11:04.020
Do you resent me?

11:05.020 --> 11:05.980
If I were afraid,

11:07.260 --> 11:08.660
I wouldn't have rushed back
from Lanyang.

11:14.900 --> 11:15.340
Sir,

11:16.620 --> 11:17.580
head to Jinzhou first

11:18.300 --> 11:19.020
and wait for things to turn.

11:23.820 --> 11:25.180
(Guanghua Gate)

11:26.540 --> 11:27.500
Keep up!

11:29.380 --> 11:29.940
(Guanghua Gate)
Hurry up.

11:30.700 --> 11:32.260
Don't stop!

11:33.700 --> 11:34.140
Hurry!

11:37.540 --> 11:38.340
Sir, today,

11:39.060 --> 11:39.500
you and I

11:40.020 --> 11:40.980
each stake our lives.

11:42.140 --> 11:43.500
How could I resent you?

11:44.700 --> 11:45.660
Each

11:46.220 --> 11:47.180
stake our lives.

11:49.260 --> 11:50.100
Well said.

11:55.100 --> 11:56.300
Stay alive.

12:00.020 --> 12:02.060
You played that game of Go well.

12:02.740 --> 12:03.700
Keep playing.

12:04.900 --> 12:06.820
You will win!

12:21.540 --> 12:22.300
By imperial command!

12:22.780 --> 12:23.620
We march today!

12:24.700 --> 12:25.500
All troops, hear my orders!

12:26.420 --> 12:27.380
Keep strict discipline!

12:27.940 --> 12:28.820
(Peace Throughout the Realm)
Fight bravely!

12:53.340 --> 12:53.940
Chancellor Liu.

13:03.300 --> 13:10.200
(Virtue Shines to Transform)

13:15.060 --> 13:15.340
Yes!

13:17.580 --> 13:18.340
Report!

13:20.100 --> 13:20.740
The city gates just opened.

13:21.060 --> 13:22.460
Many officials and soldiers poured out.

13:22.780 --> 13:23.580
Then they shut again.

13:24.380 --> 13:25.180
The city is already in disarray

13:25.460 --> 13:26.540
before the fighting has even begun.

13:27.100 --> 13:28.220
I bet most of those who fled overnight

13:28.540 --> 13:29.740
were city officials.

13:30.420 --> 13:30.700
Yes.

13:31.140 --> 13:32.420
Many officials left in their carriages.

13:32.700 --> 13:33.820
Mu Ti is a spineless fool.

13:34.420 --> 13:35.740
He's a lost cause.

13:36.940 --> 13:38.020
If he gets a chance to run,

13:38.980 --> 13:39.900
he won't hesitate.

13:40.580 --> 13:41.540
Your Royal Highness, you think

13:42.340 --> 13:43.700
the Prince of Jin may be among them?

13:44.140 --> 13:45.340
Probably not just my brother.

13:46.420 --> 13:47.380
Even my father

13:48.220 --> 13:49.940
will try to escape while he can.

13:50.300 --> 13:50.980
Go cut them off.

13:51.380 --> 13:51.620
Yes!

13:52.180 --> 13:52.580
Report!

13:54.700 --> 13:56.260
Several large carriages headed east,

13:56.420 --> 13:57.860
followed by a few mounted guards.

13:57.940 --> 13:59.420
Another large carriage headed west,

13:59.660 --> 14:00.660
accompanied by the imperial procession.

14:01.500 --> 14:02.820
I'll split our forces
and intercept them all.

14:03.340 --> 14:03.620
Wait.

14:05.140 --> 14:05.820
Is Chancellor Liu

14:06.540 --> 14:07.180
among them?

14:08.100 --> 14:09.260
He headed north
with one of the carriages.

14:09.900 --> 14:10.340
Wang Chengding.

14:11.580 --> 14:12.380
Take the main force yourself.

14:13.020 --> 14:14.940
You must stop the carriage
Chancellor Liu is with.

14:15.300 --> 14:16.620
If I'm right,

14:18.300 --> 14:19.580
my brother and father

14:20.860 --> 14:22.260
should be in it.

14:23.260 --> 14:23.700
Your Royal Highness,

14:25.260 --> 14:26.460
I'll bring them back.

14:33.260 --> 14:33.820
Take them away!

14:35.060 --> 14:35.620
Take them!

14:35.780 --> 14:36.220
Get out!

14:36.500 --> 14:36.980
Everyone out!

14:36.980 --> 14:37.300
Don't move!

14:37.380 --> 14:37.700
Hurry!

14:37.700 --> 14:38.180
Don't run!

15:04.140 --> 15:04.660
Chancellor Liu.

15:28.620 --> 15:29.380
Where's Mu Ti?

15:30.860 --> 15:31.620
And where

15:32.500 --> 15:33.660
have you hidden my father?

15:43.220 --> 15:45.820
All of you were
once loyal, brave generals.

15:46.340 --> 15:47.940
Now you bow to traitors

15:48.460 --> 15:49.860
and march on the imperial palace.

15:50.540 --> 15:53.060
Aren't you afraid of being condemned
for this for generations to come?

15:59.620 --> 16:00.220
I am

16:00.940 --> 16:02.180
Huai's rightful heir.

16:02.820 --> 16:04.900
My rule in Sheng'an
is the will of Heaven.

16:05.220 --> 16:06.060
The will of Heaven?

16:08.940 --> 16:10.420
You've stirred up war,

16:10.620 --> 16:13.780
setting beacon fires blazing,
and throwing the realm into unrest.

16:14.420 --> 16:16.460
For the land and the people,

16:17.100 --> 16:19.500
do you even show a trace
of a true ruler?

16:38.700 --> 16:39.180
Your Royal Highness.

16:39.700 --> 16:40.860
Chancellor Liu is a pillar of the state.

16:41.140 --> 16:42.020
Please spare his life.

17:04.140 --> 17:04.980
Soldiers!

17:06.860 --> 17:08.340
Hanbei and Handong

17:09.140 --> 17:10.660
both suffered severe drought this year.

17:11.620 --> 17:12.300
The court

17:12.940 --> 17:14.700
ordered granaries opened

17:15.180 --> 17:17.300
to relieve your hometowns.

17:17.700 --> 17:18.380
Yet you

17:19.180 --> 17:20.580
follow traitors.

17:21.100 --> 17:23.620
Who'll care for the starving back home?

17:25.220 --> 17:25.820
You

17:26.460 --> 17:27.980
are all soldiers of Huai.

17:28.980 --> 17:30.460
Your families have enjoyed
the state's grace.

17:31.380 --> 17:32.420
By Huai law,

17:32.780 --> 17:33.460
rebellion

17:34.020 --> 17:36.620
and treason are punishable by death!

17:38.660 --> 17:40.820
By following traitors,

17:41.020 --> 17:43.940
you betray your sovereign
and fail your people!

18:06.020 --> 18:08.020
Back then, Yan Changshan

18:08.580 --> 18:11.260
kept cursing the rebels
even after his tongue was cut out.

18:15.220 --> 18:16.020
Now,

18:16.620 --> 18:18.180
I'll follow his example.

18:19.180 --> 18:20.220
What joy.

18:20.940 --> 18:22.460
What joy!

18:47.540 --> 18:48.580
You old pedant.

19:00.420 --> 19:01.420
Thank goodness.

19:01.780 --> 19:02.340
I

19:03.020 --> 19:04.060
really am blessed.

19:04.700 --> 19:05.540
Heaven won't let me die yet.

19:24.020 --> 19:24.660
Commandant of the Guards.

19:25.060 --> 19:26.220
Chancellor Liu was intercepted
by the rebels.

19:26.780 --> 19:27.380
He was killed.

19:43.620 --> 19:45.140
(You're out here admiring)

19:45.140 --> 19:49.340
(the scenery so early in the morning.)

19:50.860 --> 19:51.860
(What fine spirits.)

19:54.980 --> 19:56.660
(Then do you dare stay)

19:57.340 --> 20:00.740
(and settle the injustices
of this realm?)

20:06.900 --> 20:08.980
(You played that game of Go well.)

20:09.660 --> 20:10.620
(Keep playing.)

20:11.740 --> 20:13.660
(You will win!)

20:17.020 --> 20:17.580
Chancellor Liu.

20:19.980 --> 20:20.860
I'll stay.

20:23.020 --> 20:23.780
I'll hold the line.

20:28.620 --> 20:29.020
Pass the order.

20:30.300 --> 20:31.660
Summon the Left and Right
Jinwu Guard Generals,

20:31.980 --> 20:33.500
the Left and Right
Shence Army Commandants,

20:33.820 --> 20:35.340
and the Zhechong Commandants
of the capital garrisons

20:36.140 --> 20:36.860
to discuss our defense.

20:37.500 --> 20:37.900
Yes!

20:38.900 --> 20:41.100
We have enough provisions
in the city for a month.

20:41.820 --> 20:42.540
Crossbow bolt supplies

20:43.380 --> 20:44.260
are limited to 300 a day.

20:44.780 --> 20:45.420
Starting today,

20:46.060 --> 20:47.820
the troops on the walls stand watch
in shifts, day and night.

20:48.460 --> 20:49.820
Report all military developments to me.

20:51.060 --> 20:52.060
I'll hold the line right here.

20:56.100 --> 20:58.460
Both rebel armies have marched
a long way to attack us.

20:59.020 --> 20:59.820
Their supplies must be running low.

21:01.020 --> 21:01.980
We must hold them off.

21:02.980 --> 21:03.580
Yes!

21:04.100 --> 21:04.820
We've reached Sheng'an.

21:05.220 --> 21:06.660
We have to strike fast to win.

21:08.060 --> 21:08.660
Stock up on provisions.

21:09.180 --> 21:09.900
We must take the city

21:10.340 --> 21:11.140
within three days,

21:12.140 --> 21:12.940
five at most.

21:13.220 --> 21:13.620
Your Royal Highness.

21:14.900 --> 21:16.660
Sheng'an's walls are said
to be impregnable.

21:17.060 --> 21:18.660
A direct assault may not work.

21:21.980 --> 21:23.980
(Sheng'an)

21:25.820 --> 21:27.180
Then think of something else.

21:28.140 --> 21:32.860
(Sheng'an)

21:32.860 --> 21:39.500
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

21:49.060 --> 21:51.180
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

21:54.060 --> 21:59.540
(Virtue Shines to Transform)

22:06.820 --> 22:09.780
(Virtue Shines to Transform)

22:20.940 --> 22:21.380
Wenji.

22:22.060 --> 22:22.740
Are we there yet?

22:43.420 --> 22:47.620
Your Majesty, welcome to Jinzhou!

22:47.780 --> 22:51.060
Long live Your Majesty!

22:54.660 --> 22:56.820
(Residence of the Prefect of Jinzhou)

22:56.820 --> 22:58.220
Come on, fill it up.

23:03.740 --> 23:04.420
Mr. Liu, please.

23:05.140 --> 23:06.100
Please.

23:07.460 --> 23:08.500
Come on, drink up.

23:09.220 --> 23:10.220
You hold your liquor well, sir.

23:11.580 --> 23:12.420
Very good.

23:13.540 --> 23:14.100
Fill it up.

23:15.620 --> 23:16.700
Come on.

23:17.540 --> 23:18.180
Fill it up.

23:25.380 --> 23:25.860
Fang Tong.

23:26.860 --> 23:27.620
It's been three years.

23:27.980 --> 23:28.820
Commander Yan, how have you been?

23:29.260 --> 23:29.940
It's been a long time.

23:37.420 --> 23:38.580
Why are so many people gathered
down there?

23:41.140 --> 23:42.020
(Guanghua Gate)

23:42.020 --> 23:42.500
Report!

23:44.420 --> 23:44.980
What's happening?

23:45.340 --> 23:46.740
The rebels have looted every farm

23:46.900 --> 23:48.220
and field around Sheng'an.

23:48.780 --> 23:49.820
Stored grain seized as military rations.

23:50.140 --> 23:51.140
Green wheat cut for horse feed.

23:51.780 --> 23:52.540
The people are terrified

23:53.260 --> 23:54.300
and want to take refuge in the city,

23:54.380 --> 23:54.740
so...

23:55.580 --> 23:57.060
So they've gathered outside the gates.

23:59.980 --> 24:00.460
What's wrong?

24:01.380 --> 24:02.340
My home

24:03.180 --> 24:04.060
is just outside the city.

24:09.900 --> 24:11.100
Open the gates!

24:24.260 --> 24:25.700
(Guanghua Gate)

24:27.500 --> 24:28.100
(Guanghua Gate)
Are they insane?

24:28.740 --> 24:29.620
They're killing innocent civilians

24:30.060 --> 24:31.140
just to force us to open the gates!

24:31.740 --> 24:32.340
If we open them,

24:33.300 --> 24:34.620
they'll storm the city.

24:35.860 --> 24:36.340
If we don't,

24:37.260 --> 24:38.860
we'll lose the people's trust.

24:44.260 --> 24:45.380
(Guanghua Gate)

24:47.820 --> 24:49.260
(Guanghua Gate)

25:30.180 --> 25:33.940
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

25:44.100 --> 25:45.780
(Guanghua Gate)

25:48.180 --> 25:48.700
Report!

25:50.500 --> 25:50.940
What is it?

25:51.540 --> 25:54.100
The commander defending the city sent
Shence Army elites out to fight.

25:56.100 --> 25:57.540
Sending cavalry to rescue civilians?

25:58.500 --> 25:59.500
Quite a sacrifice.

26:01.140 --> 26:02.980
Who's holding Sheng'an now?

26:03.260 --> 26:04.620
I hear it's a county magistrate.

26:04.820 --> 26:05.580
A magistrate?

26:06.940 --> 26:07.660
Which one?

26:10.340 --> 26:11.060
It's Yan Shang.

26:20.620 --> 26:21.100
Tan Yuanchun.

26:21.700 --> 26:21.980
Here.

26:22.540 --> 26:23.140
Move out!

26:23.460 --> 26:23.740
Yes!

26:51.660 --> 26:52.300
Attack!

26:55.620 --> 26:56.260
(Guanghua Gate)

26:58.260 --> 26:59.300
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

27:07.420 --> 27:08.180
Run!

27:09.820 --> 27:11.460
Run! Hurry!

27:36.780 --> 27:37.380
Hang in there!

27:39.780 --> 27:40.380
Bear with it.

27:45.140 --> 27:46.540
Our harvest...

27:46.980 --> 27:48.100
The wheat would've been golden

27:48.380 --> 27:49.340
in just half a month.

27:49.340 --> 27:50.460
How are we supposed to survive?

27:50.580 --> 27:52.420
What are we going to do?

28:26.900 --> 28:27.700
Thank you.

28:27.980 --> 28:29.060
Thank you so much.

28:36.620 --> 28:39.940
(Guanghua Gate)

28:51.780 --> 28:53.420
It's the deposed Crown Prince!

28:53.900 --> 28:55.740
It's the deposed Crown Prince!

28:56.220 --> 28:57.740
It's the deposed Crown Prince!

28:58.020 --> 29:00.580
It's the deposed Crown Prince!

29:24.380 --> 29:26.020
Several blocks of homes in Sheng'an
have burned down.

29:26.380 --> 29:28.060
The whole city is in a panic.

29:28.500 --> 29:29.340
The people are terrified of war.

29:29.940 --> 29:31.700
That's exactly what we want. Panic.

29:32.740 --> 29:34.100
To break the enemy without fighting.

29:34.740 --> 29:35.700
I'll take Sheng'an

29:36.500 --> 29:37.740
without shedding a drop of blood.

29:39.740 --> 29:40.220
Your Royal Highness.

29:41.420 --> 29:42.420
Even if we must take the city,

29:42.700 --> 29:43.380
these tactics

29:44.420 --> 29:46.140
are too cruel.

29:46.940 --> 29:48.020
Winner takes all.

29:48.380 --> 29:49.460
If the city falls, I live.

29:51.460 --> 29:52.700
If the army's defeated, I die.

29:56.420 --> 29:56.980
Yang Si.

29:58.340 --> 29:59.180
They're only defending

29:59.620 --> 30:00.420
the city, never attacking.

30:01.300 --> 30:02.460
What do you think they're waiting for?

30:04.380 --> 30:05.420
Reinforcements!

30:14.100 --> 30:14.980
I'll lead the attack myself

30:17.180 --> 30:18.140
tomorrow morning.

30:30.180 --> 30:31.100
No unauthorized visitors allowed!

30:31.140 --> 30:31.980
I need to see Commander Yan.

30:34.140 --> 30:34.620
Wei Shu?

30:36.060 --> 30:36.500
Yan Shang.

30:37.980 --> 30:38.380
Yan Shang.

30:40.380 --> 30:41.340
I know you're defending the city.

30:41.660 --> 30:42.380
I didn't want to bother you.

30:42.780 --> 30:45.020
But those rebels are out of their minds.

30:45.420 --> 30:46.420
They've even set fire to people's homes.

30:46.780 --> 30:47.500
I may be useless,

30:47.980 --> 30:48.860
but I want to do my part.

30:49.620 --> 30:50.300
What do you have in mind?

30:50.860 --> 30:52.380
I haven't left my alchemy room
in two years.

30:52.740 --> 30:54.500
I've figured out the secrets
of saltpeter and sulfur.

30:54.780 --> 30:55.540
If you give the order,

30:55.940 --> 30:57.300
I can start making

30:57.580 --> 30:58.220
gunpowder today.

30:58.580 --> 30:59.180
Gunpowder?

31:00.340 --> 31:00.980
Like firecrackers.

31:01.420 --> 31:02.220
With adjustments to the formula,

31:02.420 --> 31:03.500
it could be dozens of times
more powerful.

31:04.460 --> 31:06.300
I thought it might help.

31:06.980 --> 31:07.620
Excellent.

31:07.900 --> 31:08.500
How long will it take?

31:09.060 --> 31:09.940
If all goes well,

31:10.260 --> 31:10.900
three days.

31:14.300 --> 31:14.980
I can make

31:15.260 --> 31:16.580
a small batch
in as little as one day and one night.

31:17.940 --> 31:18.700
And if things don't go well?

31:20.620 --> 31:21.420
Then

31:22.060 --> 31:23.100
the alchemy room
in the Princess's Residence

31:23.340 --> 31:24.820
will be blown to ashes along with me.

31:29.340 --> 31:30.180
What materials do you need?

31:30.500 --> 31:31.620
I'll have them requisitioned at once.

31:32.100 --> 31:33.100
Just go ahead and do it.

31:39.340 --> 31:39.740
Yan Shang.

31:41.180 --> 31:42.140
Why isn't the Princess here?

31:42.500 --> 31:43.100
Where is she?

31:49.300 --> 31:50.180
She'll be back.

31:55.540 --> 31:58.900
(Border of the Central Circuit,
North Jing)

32:02.740 --> 32:07.580
(Border of the Central Circuit,
North Jing)

32:12.740 --> 32:13.780
Two and a half jin of saltpeter.

32:14.460 --> 32:15.260
One liang of hemp fiber.

32:15.900 --> 32:16.620
One liang of dry lacquer.

32:17.260 --> 32:18.180
And one liang of arsenic.

32:18.300 --> 32:18.860
I've weighed them all.

32:23.020 --> 32:23.620
Miss Zhao.

32:24.420 --> 32:25.180
It's too dangerous in here.

32:25.820 --> 32:26.620
Maybe you should...

32:26.740 --> 32:27.500
Cut it out.

32:27.660 --> 32:28.260
What else do I need to do?

32:29.980 --> 32:31.100
We need a lot of clay jars,

32:31.460 --> 32:33.260
oil cloth, paste, and fuses.

32:33.700 --> 32:35.140
Pack the jars with gunpowder,

32:35.500 --> 32:36.620
broken tiles, and iron nails.

32:37.060 --> 32:37.860
Seal them with tung oil.

32:38.300 --> 32:39.300
Then insert the powder fuse.

32:40.220 --> 32:40.620
I'll go get them.

32:42.700 --> 32:43.380
What's a powder fuse?

32:45.060 --> 32:46.740
A thin cord made by rolling paper
soaked in powder.

32:47.020 --> 32:47.940
It's used to ignite the gunpowder.

32:49.260 --> 32:50.060
Where can we get that?

32:50.860 --> 32:52.060
How thick should the paper cord be?

32:52.420 --> 32:53.100
I can make it.

32:53.300 --> 32:54.820
Yes, we can all make it.

32:54.820 --> 32:55.300
Don't come in.

32:55.900 --> 32:57.460
This room is full of gunpowder.
Too dangerous.

32:57.860 --> 32:58.780
Look at the situation we're in.

32:59.100 --> 33:01.460
Just tell us
what the fuse should look like.

33:02.300 --> 33:07.660
♪May the endless wind linger for me♪

33:09.220 --> 33:14.860
♪Let the storms sweep the hills bare;
still, I cling to dreams of home♪

33:14.900 --> 33:18.660
♪If one day my homeland calls,
my heart stays true♪

33:18.660 --> 33:20.740
Your Highness, all the troops
you requested have been assembled

33:21.020 --> 33:22.020
and are waiting at the border.

33:24.380 --> 33:24.940
Thank you, General.

33:24.940 --> 33:28.220
♪Whose eyes have seen
the smoke of war?♪

33:28.260 --> 33:29.860
In the three years of your reign,

33:30.340 --> 33:31.620
you've shown North Jing great care.

33:32.380 --> 33:34.020
We are all grateful.

33:34.540 --> 33:35.260
When you give an order,

33:35.700 --> 33:36.620
we obey.

33:36.620 --> 33:40.100
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

33:40.100 --> 33:40.820
North Jing is in my hands.

33:41.260 --> 33:42.220
You all go with Her Highness.

33:42.940 --> 33:43.260
Yes.

33:43.460 --> 33:43.740
Yes.

33:43.740 --> 33:49.220
♪May the moon shine on us forever♪
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)

33:49.220 --> 33:49.860
(Meng Zaishi,)

33:51.020 --> 33:51.460
(rest assured.)

33:53.220 --> 33:54.500
(I'll bring your troops back.)

34:14.100 --> 34:15.580
Tierong, give me a squad of cavalry.

34:15.940 --> 34:16.740
I'll ride ahead

34:17.180 --> 34:18.500
and get half a day's lead on you.

34:19.020 --> 34:20.220
You lead the main force on.

34:20.420 --> 34:20.700
Alright.

34:21.300 --> 34:21.780
I'll force-march

34:21.780 --> 34:23.300
along the route you've planned.

34:24.300 --> 34:25.420
Gu Han, come with me!

34:28.220 --> 34:33.180
♪Someday, we'll sail and feed the gulls♪

34:33.380 --> 34:35.820
♪Gaze upon the land
and guard it with you♪

34:35.820 --> 34:36.500
Who goes there?

34:37.780 --> 34:39.380
The garrison of Qinzhou
is here to receive you!

34:39.620 --> 34:40.460
We're joining the relief of Sheng'an!

34:42.020 --> 34:44.060
The Princess Regent ordered us
to prepare provisions,

34:44.260 --> 34:45.020
ready our troops,

34:45.260 --> 34:46.140
and join forces with you!

34:46.300 --> 34:46.740
Thank you.

34:46.740 --> 34:51.300
♪I'd trade all the world's romance
for one moment of tenderness♪

34:51.300 --> 34:52.580
(The Princess Regent is here!)

34:52.980 --> 34:54.580
(Pei Yun, Prefect of Tongzhou,
receive the order!)

34:54.900 --> 34:56.580
(Du Tong, Military Commander
of Zhangzhou, receive the order!)

34:56.900 --> 34:58.620
(Fang Yuan, Prefect of Yuzhou,
receive the order!)

34:58.980 --> 35:00.020
(By order of the Princess Regent,)

35:00.300 --> 35:02.140
(garrisons in prefectures along the way,
armor up and form ranks!)

35:02.380 --> 35:03.180
(Travel light!)

35:03.300 --> 35:04.740
(Rush to Sheng'an's aid!)

35:04.740 --> 35:06.620
♪Blood stains my sleeves as I
stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

35:07.260 --> 35:11.460
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

35:11.700 --> 35:18.340
♪May you live a life free of sorrow;
may the moon shine on us forever♪

35:20.940 --> 35:22.180
People of Sheng'an, hear me!

35:22.980 --> 35:24.460
I am Huai's rightful heir.

35:24.740 --> 35:26.180
I can't bear to see my people suffer!

35:26.980 --> 35:27.460
Today,

35:27.940 --> 35:28.780
whoever opens the city gates

35:29.820 --> 35:30.860
will receive a thousand taels of gold.

35:32.300 --> 35:33.660
Whoever captures the impostor Yan Shang

35:34.820 --> 35:35.860
will be made a marquis.

35:36.380 --> 35:38.420
Anyone who joins me
will be forgiven for past crimes.

35:38.700 --> 35:39.380
Those who resist

35:40.060 --> 35:41.140
will be slain on sight!

35:41.660 --> 35:42.380
Pah!

35:42.980 --> 35:43.900
Rightful heir, my foot!

35:44.460 --> 35:45.620
You wretch!

35:46.540 --> 35:47.300
Exactly!

35:47.740 --> 35:48.620
With the war raging,

35:48.900 --> 35:50.500
we can still buy rice and medicine
in the city.

35:50.700 --> 35:51.820
Things haven't fallen apart.

35:52.100 --> 35:53.540
All thanks to Scholar Yan!

35:56.300 --> 35:57.020
(Guanghua Gate)
Are you done?

35:59.260 --> 36:00.620
If so, it's my turn.

36:03.220 --> 36:05.340
I am Yan Shang,
Commandant of the Guards.

36:06.580 --> 36:07.780
Hear me, soldiers,

36:08.660 --> 36:09.700
both rebel and loyal!

36:11.380 --> 36:12.700
You all come from good families.

36:13.740 --> 36:14.700
The people inside

36:15.580 --> 36:17.100
and outside this city
are all Huai's subjects.

36:19.060 --> 36:20.140
Whomever your weapons strike,

36:21.700 --> 36:23.260
they are your own kin and neighbors.

36:25.340 --> 36:25.940
You have been

36:26.900 --> 36:28.580
misled by the traitor Mu Xun.

36:29.980 --> 36:31.180
This is not what you truly want!

36:32.340 --> 36:32.700
Now

36:33.740 --> 36:34.700
Sheng'an lies in ruins...

36:35.500 --> 36:36.380
What are you waiting for?

36:37.260 --> 36:37.620
Are you

36:37.980 --> 36:39.580
going to let him keep poisoning
people's minds?

36:40.300 --> 36:42.660
Anyone who lays down their arms
and surrenders now

36:43.900 --> 36:44.940
will be pardoned

36:45.460 --> 36:46.740
and may return home!

36:47.380 --> 36:48.620
The harvest is near.

36:50.060 --> 36:51.460
Your wives and children
are waiting for you!

36:51.460 --> 36:51.860
Shoot him!

36:53.140 --> 36:54.860
(Guanghua Gate)

37:17.220 --> 37:18.700
Would you rather die on foreign soil

37:20.260 --> 37:21.740
or return home?

37:23.780 --> 37:25.380
Proclaim it throughout the camps

37:27.660 --> 37:29.740
and let all hear!

37:33.380 --> 37:33.900
My life

37:34.620 --> 37:35.660
is of no consequence.

37:36.620 --> 37:37.900
Do not worry about me.

37:37.900 --> 37:39.260
(Guanghua Gate)

37:45.140 --> 37:45.780
Your priority

37:46.980 --> 37:48.340
is to defend the city.

38:05.220 --> 38:07.140
- Commander Yan!
- Commander Yan!

38:07.140 --> 38:08.020
Call the imperial physician!

38:08.380 --> 38:08.860
Commander Yan!

38:08.980 --> 38:09.420
Commander Yan!

38:10.740 --> 38:12.740
Commander Yan says
as long as we stand, the city stands!

38:13.060 --> 38:14.500
As long as we stand together,

38:14.700 --> 38:16.500
Sheng'an will never fall!

38:16.500 --> 38:18.620
With Commander Yan here,
we have nothing to fear!

38:18.860 --> 38:20.900
Commander Yan, you've suffered so much!

38:22.220 --> 38:23.580
The rebel Yan Shang is dead!

38:27.860 --> 38:28.580
Attack!

38:30.940 --> 38:33.500
(Guanghua Gate)

38:36.300 --> 38:37.380
(Guanghua Gate)

38:37.380 --> 38:38.220
Set the ladders!

38:38.980 --> 38:40.380
Hold them steady! Climb!

38:50.980 --> 38:51.540
Hold them off.

38:51.940 --> 38:52.660
Don't let them in!

38:55.100 --> 38:55.620
Someone!

38:55.900 --> 38:56.700
Someone!

38:59.300 --> 38:59.540
Hurry!

39:03.180 --> 39:03.460
Quick!

39:09.900 --> 39:12.860
(Guanghua Gate)

39:28.740 --> 39:29.220
It worked.

39:29.940 --> 39:30.660
You did it!

39:31.180 --> 39:32.140
We did it.

39:33.420 --> 39:35.780
Everyone, keep lighting them!

39:55.140 --> 39:55.500
Commander Yan.

39:56.140 --> 39:56.660
Bring it here. Hurry.

39:59.500 --> 39:59.820
Quick.

40:05.300 --> 40:05.700
Commander Yan.

40:06.380 --> 40:06.660
Hurry!

40:11.940 --> 40:12.460
Here, the medicine.

40:12.900 --> 40:13.100
Here.

40:21.380 --> 40:22.500
We owe it all to Commander Yan.

40:22.500 --> 40:25.300
Now rumors are spreading
and morale's in chaos.

40:25.860 --> 40:27.260
We need to do something.

40:27.660 --> 40:29.460
They claim that Yan Shang died
and his head has been sent to the army.

40:29.740 --> 40:30.620
That's utter nonsense!

40:32.220 --> 40:32.820
But now...

40:34.060 --> 40:35.140
Commander Yan looks...

40:39.260 --> 40:40.460
Imperial Physician, how is he?

40:40.980 --> 40:43.540
The arrow pierced Commander Yan's lung.

40:43.660 --> 40:45.860
He's lost a lot of blood,
and the fever hasn't broken.

40:46.980 --> 40:47.740
His life

40:48.340 --> 40:50.660
is hanging by a thread.

40:51.500 --> 40:54.580
All we can do now is
try everything to stop the bleeding.

40:59.020 --> 41:00.180
Blood! Blood!

41:00.700 --> 41:01.900
The bleeding won't stop!

41:03.060 --> 41:03.660
Stop the bleeding!

41:04.260 --> 41:04.820
Someone!

41:05.580 --> 41:06.780
Help stop the bleeding! Quick!

41:07.060 --> 41:09.420
The bleeding won't stop!

41:09.660 --> 41:11.020
Someone, help!

41:11.500 --> 41:12.380
The bleeding won't stop!

41:12.620 --> 41:12.980
Your Royal Highness,

41:13.540 --> 41:15.020
Yan Shang's words
have spread everywhere.

41:15.420 --> 41:17.060
The people of Sheng'an are defending
the city with soaring morale.

41:17.340 --> 41:18.340
Our troops are losing heart.

41:18.620 --> 41:19.420
If we keep attacking,

41:20.100 --> 41:21.260
I'm afraid we'll suffer heavy losses.

41:21.580 --> 41:22.820
We've come this far.

41:23.940 --> 41:25.780
Who cares about losses now?

41:26.140 --> 41:27.420
Once I take Sheng'an,

41:28.820 --> 41:29.860
every one of you

41:31.020 --> 41:32.660
will be honored!

41:37.060 --> 41:37.500
Follow me

41:39.020 --> 41:40.380
and keep attacking tomorrow.

41:41.540 --> 41:43.180
No one is to undermine
the troops' morale.

41:44.300 --> 41:44.740
Your Royal Highness,

41:45.420 --> 41:46.860
forcing soldiers
to throw their lives away

41:47.220 --> 41:47.700
may

41:48.300 --> 41:49.140
destroy our morale.

41:49.140 --> 41:49.620
Yang Si!

42:00.100 --> 42:00.900
They're under siege.

42:01.460 --> 42:03.020
Their arrows and provisions are limited.

42:03.700 --> 42:05.740
How much saltpeter and sulfur
could they possibly have?

42:06.260 --> 42:07.460
I'd like to see

42:08.140 --> 42:09.180
how long

42:10.380 --> 42:11.940
their bombs can last.

42:22.300 --> 42:24.260
Sir, word from Sheng'an...

42:24.540 --> 42:26.380
How dare you disrupt
the imperial audience!

42:28.020 --> 42:28.700
Your Majesty,

42:29.020 --> 42:30.220
word from Sheng'an

42:30.460 --> 42:32.220
is that the defender, Scholar Yan,
has been killed in battle.

42:32.500 --> 42:33.780
Sheng'an has fallen?

42:34.100 --> 42:35.260
When the messenger left,

42:35.460 --> 42:37.100
the city was on the verge of falling.

42:37.380 --> 42:37.780
We

42:38.420 --> 42:39.260
don't know its fate now.

42:39.700 --> 42:40.260
This is bad.

42:42.140 --> 42:43.940
If Mu Xun takes Sheng'an...

42:44.180 --> 42:45.180
(Cui Quan, Prefect of Jinzhou)

42:45.180 --> 42:46.060
Don't panic, Your Majesty.

42:46.500 --> 42:47.820
Jinzhou is far from Sheng'an.

42:48.060 --> 42:48.900
They won't reach us

42:49.140 --> 42:50.300
anytime soon.

42:51.020 --> 42:52.820
That's not far at all!

42:55.780 --> 42:57.700
Mu Xun is ruthless.

42:58.300 --> 42:59.940
Once he secures Sheng'an,

43:01.020 --> 43:02.540
he'll come straight for us.

43:03.460 --> 43:03.860
I have to leave.

43:05.260 --> 43:05.580
I have to go.

43:07.060 --> 43:08.260
I must leave at once!

43:09.420 --> 43:10.060
I'm heading south!

43:10.300 --> 43:10.860
Your Majesty!

43:11.220 --> 43:11.580
Your Majesty...

43:11.660 --> 43:12.020
Your Majesty.

43:12.180 --> 43:12.860
No way.

43:12.860 --> 43:13.420
You mustn't!

43:13.420 --> 43:14.540
No way they can cross the Yangtze River.

43:14.540 --> 43:16.700
Your Majesty, you can't go alone.

43:16.900 --> 43:18.860
I'll accompany you south!

43:18.860 --> 43:20.140
Your Majesty!

43:20.780 --> 43:21.380
Slow down.

43:21.540 --> 43:22.140
Keep up! Hurry!

43:34.100 --> 43:34.580
Come on.

43:35.140 --> 43:37.340
I've come up with a good solution.

43:38.380 --> 43:39.060
If...

43:39.860 --> 43:42.140
If Mu Xun catches up with me...

43:43.460 --> 43:45.780
Chancellor Liu and Yan Shang
are both dead anyway.

43:46.980 --> 43:47.740
I'll just say

43:48.300 --> 43:49.700
it was Mu Wanyao!

43:50.460 --> 43:51.940
She's the real usurper!

43:54.900 --> 43:55.780
Yan Shang is dead?

44:00.060 --> 44:04.820
(Next Episode Preview)

44:05.340 --> 44:08.140
I'll order
the Noble Consort's execution.

44:08.580 --> 44:11.420
How thoughtful of you now.

44:16.260 --> 44:16.660
No!

44:22.761 --> 44:26.054
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

44:28.739 --> 44:33.655
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

44:35.849 --> 44:41.694
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

44:42.194 --> 44:47.420
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

44:50.189 --> 44:54.980
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

44:55.816 --> 45:01.895
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:03.696 --> 45:06.846
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:06.846 --> 45:08.494
♪Burning bright as a song♪

45:08.546 --> 45:12.270
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

45:12.648 --> 45:17.314
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

45:17.933 --> 45:21.974
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

45:22.465 --> 45:24.580
♪Not a single hour less♪

45:24.620 --> 45:31.566
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

45:32.329 --> 45:35.782
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

45:35.962 --> 45:39.107
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

45:39.546 --> 45:46.183
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

45:46.580 --> 45:48.618
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

45:48.618 --> 45:51.094
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

45:51.132 --> 45:53.601
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:53.805 --> 46:00.692
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:01.004 --> 46:04.275
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:04.580 --> 46:07.753
♪My last untouched innocence♪

46:08.077 --> 46:11.503
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

46:11.736 --> 46:14.961
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

46:15.292 --> 46:22.088
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

46:22.457 --> 46:24.519
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:24.520 --> 46:27.023
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:27.070 --> 46:29.408
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:29.639 --> 46:36.474
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

46:36.823 --> 46:38.441
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

46:38.571 --> 46:40.367
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

46:40.724 --> 46:43.741
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:43.781 --> 46:45.108
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
